    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elija na kusoweka kwa vua",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mlodi uwangwaghwa Elija wa isanga ja Tishbi jiko Gileadi ukamzera Ahabu, “Kwa irina ja BWANA Mlungu wa Israeli ukaiagha moyo, uo Mlungu nimdumikiagha, vua ndeichaanya ndoenyi hata mami ghangi kuwoneka isaakaia kwa ilagho nichaajighora.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JAS.5.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jak. 5.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko BWANA ukamzera Elija, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Fuma aha kughende cha mashariki, nao kukuvise aho kaavui na kamoda ka Kerithi kiko mashariki ya Jordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchakaia kukinywa machi gha ako kamoda; nameria kulaghira ngorusa rikuredieghe vindo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Elija ukamsikira BWANA ukaghenda na kukaia kaavui na ako kamoda ka Kerithi kiko mashariki ya Jordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngorusa rikamredia mkate na nyama nakesho na nakenyi, ukakaia ukinywa machi kufuma kwa ako kamoda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma ya matuku matini, ako komoda kikaoma kwa wundu ghwa vua kusoweka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elija na mka-mkiwa wa isanga ja Zarefathi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko BWANA ukamzera Elija, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wuka kughende isanga ja Zarefathi jiko Sidoni, kukaie aho. Ola namlaghira muka-mkiwa ukaiagha aho ukunekeghe vindo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.4.25+LUK.4.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 4.25-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Elija ukawuka ukaghenda Zarefathi; hata iji wavika mbengenyi ya muzi, ukammbona muka mkiwa ukishoa mbande, ukammbanga ukamzera, “Tafadhali kuniredie machi matini ninyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iji wawoka kughendaonda machi, Elija ukamzera, “Kunidwae na kamkate.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uja muka ukamzera, “Naghema kwa BWANA Mlungu wako uko moyo siwadie mkate. Neeka na kamufu katini mkoponyi, na mavuda matini chupenyi; nawuyashoa iri mbande eri nibonye mkate, dije na mwana wapo diwonebwaghwa ni njala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elija ukamzera, “Kusakeobua, ghenda kubonye sa iji koni kwaghamba; ela kuzoye kunibonyere ini kamkate katini kuniredie, ima konyuma kukubonyere oho na mwana wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia BWANA, uo Mlungu wa Israeli waghamba huwu, ‘Ugho mufu ghuko mkoponyi ndeghuchaasia, na agho mavuda ghiko chupenyi ndeghichaasia, hata ituku jija ini BWANA nichaareda vua ndoenyi.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uja muka ukaghenda ukabonya seji uzerelo ni Elija; wikakaia na vindo va kuwikata wose kwa matuku mengi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na sa iji koni BWANA oreghorieghe kwa momu ghwa Elija, ghuja mufu ndeghoresirieghe mkoponyi, na ghaja mavuda ndegheresirieghe chupenyi anduangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuma ya agho, mwana wa uja muka mkiwa ukawuya mkongo; wukongo ghwake ghukachurikia na kutua ukafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uja muka ukamzera Elija, “Kwaki kunibonyere huwu? Welee, koocha kwapo eri kumkumbuse Mlungu kaung'a yapo hata mwana wapo ufo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elija ukamzera, “Nineke mwana wako.” Nao ukammbwada kufuma laghenyi kwake, ukamdwa cha chumbenyi cha ighu aho orekoghe ukikaia; ukamrarisha wulinyi ghwake ghoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao ukamkemia BWANA ukighamba, “Ee BWANA Mlungu wapo, kwaki kwamredia u muka mkiwa wasi ingelo nawuyakaia kwake kiwughenyi, hata kukam'bwagha mwana wake?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukakughorua aighu ya uja mwana mando adadu ukimkemia Bwana na kughamba, “Ee BWANA Mlungu wapo, mmbunjire u mwana roho yake.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.4.34+2KI.4.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Waz. 4.34-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao BWANA ukasikira malombi gha Elija, na roho ya uja mwana ikammburia, ukazoya kusoda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elija ukammbwada uja mwana kufuma chumba cha ighu, ukamreda kwa mae ukaghamba, “Wona mwana wako oko moyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uja muka ukamzera Elija, “Idana namanya kukaia ko mundu wa Mlungu, hata malagho gha BWANA kwawuyadeda ni gha loli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
